撸到空投的那一刻，就像是亲手种出来的果实，甚至像自己的孩子一样，
怎么忍心立刻卖掉？
就算卖掉也是经历千百万次的心里拉扯，
知道该卖，可就是点不下那个鼠标。。
就像年少时第一次分手，
明知道不合适，却怎么都说不出口那2个字。

所以才懂得第一次的重要性。
后来我才明白，才懂得，第一次的重要性。
「卖出，分手，是一门必修课」

我们必须学会：

市场不会奖励感情用事，

能卖掉的，才是属于你的</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative h-0" style="padding-bottom:68%"><div class="absolute -inset-0.5"><div class="group/carousel relative h-full"><div class="h-full w-full"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex overflow-x-auto gap-1 h-full snap-x snap-mandatory overscroll-x-contain py-0.5 -ms-3.5 -me-3.5 ps-4 pe-4"><div class="border-normal h-full min-h-0 min-w-[auto] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style="aspect-ratio:1.1764705882352942"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" aria-label="Image" href="/KuiGas/status/1937542066449617162/photo/1"><img fetchPriority="high" height="1382" width="1944" alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" decoding="async" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GuOAq34agAgXVhw?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GuOAq34agAgXVhw?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GuOAq34agAgXVhw?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GuOAq34agAgXVhw?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/KuiGas/status/1937542066449617162/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="border-normal h-full min-h-0 min-w-[auto] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style="aspect-ratio:1.1764705882352942"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appear